  m_Text: "BASE RATINGS  \xB7  50 / 100 EACH\n\nNERVE   Cornering grip.\nFIRE   Top pace and braking balance.\nBIDDABILITY   Turning response to the reins.\nHEART   Pace conditioning in later rounds.\n\nThese are Copper's current base ratings. Free practice uses the first round; Heart does not add pace here. Earned levels and training are still in development. Tack changes appearance only."
